  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - OIL &amp; GAS SECTOR, through Government of India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is providing funding in the amount of $628,926 for a grant to Hindustan Petroleum Corporation Limited (HPCL) to fund technical assistance (TA) for an asset integrity management project for its petroleum refineries and associated pipelines. The TA introduces HPCL to a wide range of advanced safety technologies and methodologies to minimize the risks and vulnerabilities of HPCL&apos;s petroleum operations and protect the safety of the workforce and neighboring population. The TA involves training and on-site demonstrations, as well as introducing advanced methods and processes for conducting comprehensive inspection programs.</narrative>
  </description>
